- T238 (completion, queue #105): build sha 3f6dba31 stands from Wave 38 (17,349 B), segment 7.000 s. Cures priced in scores.md (firing-2): (1) COMP-C1000/COMP-C1250 companions add readableCount === 24 predicate and print it; (2) C2500/C3500/C4500 receipts print evaluated CONFIG expression + equality check, fixed side executed separately; (3) P7/P8 CONFIG-derived runs (P7 full-field equality + step transition at derived instants; P8 opacity predicates at derived interior samples) + moved P7/P8 samples under timing swap; (4) cure-paragraph coordinate error already corrected in build-record. Completion form: apply ONLY the filed cures → fresh own-checks + A6 legs → A13 receipt index re-reconciled (assertion inheritance whole) → ONE jev-prewave completion re-fire → on FIRE-WAVE, five-lens wave bound to that build; on HOLD, NO VERDICT, next re-fire PENDING AUTHORIZATION.
