- **Own-checks completeness.** The filed harness now passes `CONFIG.timing.tReticleMs` to `stateAt`. The rerun printed `0 ms`, with reticle progress, icons started, and formula progress all zero. CP8m evaluates `(dissolveEndMs + durationMs) / 2` at 9500 ms by default and 10175 ms after the expansion timing swap. Both instants fall inside the binding 7000–12900 ms interval. At each instant, the full state equaled its configuration’s CP7 state, board opacity was zero, and all 40 icons were complete. I counted 28 PASS lines and zero FAIL lines. The completion index retains the inherited assertions and accounts for all eight guards, including the post-wave arithmetic disposition for command 4. Both inline scripts parsed. The seven fit rows identify PIL `ImageFont.getbbox` and DejaVu Serif as the measurement instrument and proxy font. [Harness, CP0](../../../../study/recreations/T241-probability-board-opening/harness-t241.js:25) · [Harness, swapped CP8m](../../../../study/recreations/T241-probability-board-opening/harness-t241.js:98) · [Completion receipt index](../../../../study/recreations/T241-probability-board-opening/build-record.md:166) · [Fit table](../../../../study/recreations/T241-probability-board-opening/fit-table.md:3)
- **Parameterization.** The swaps regenerated the formula, slot word and result together, changed the array from 40 to 32 icons, moved the timing probes, and applied the new ink color. The census total of 109 is reproducible as 106 scalar leaves plus three array containers, with 27 timing fields. The §2c lead-in says eight paths were flagged, while its table enumerates eleven. That tally discrepancy does not identify a missing key or receipt. [Harness, swaps](../../../../study/recreations/T241-probability-board-opening/harness-t241.js:75) · [Config census §2c](../../../../study/recreations/T241-probability-board-opening/config-census.md:58)
