- **Fidelity-plan honesty.** The binding mapping discloses the compressed opening draw-on, the expansion timing departure, and the array-only hold in place of T242’s bars. The packet section also records the caption exclusion and the English callout gloss. [Observe/Plan §1.1](../2026-11-18-cycle-041-wave-38/item-T241-observe-plan.md:15) · [Observe/Plan §2.2](../2026-11-18-cycle-041-wave-38/item-T241-observe-plan.md:89)

